<title>USA: Sonoma Valley Q2 results.</title>
<headline>Sonoma Valley Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>SONOMA, Calif. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonoma Valley Bank reported net earnings for the first six months of 1997 of $620,000 or $1.05 per share compared to $554,000 or $0.93 per share in 1996, a 12% increase.</p>
<p>The bank posted total assets of $96 Million at June 30, 1997, an increase of 22% over the same period in 1996.  Total deposits grew to $86 Million, up 19% from $72 Million for the quarter ending June 30, 1996.  Total loans reached $57 Million, up 14% from $50 Million one year ago.</p>
</text>
